{"id":"427306","name":"酸萝卜鸭掌汤","author":"我是狂草","authorId":"9407270","desc":"","cover":"images/427306/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭掌","amount":"500克"},{"name":"酸萝卜老鸭汤料","amount":"1袋"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"2茶匙"},{"name":"老姜","amount":"少讦"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸭掌冲洗，冷水下锅，放姜片、料酒；","img":"images/427306/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"大火浇沸；","img":"images/427306/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒出，用凉水冲洗干净。","img":"images/427306/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入炖锅，加足水量；","img":"images/427306/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大火烧沸，打尽浮沫；","img":"images/427306/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放酸萝卜老鸭汤料；","img":"images/427306/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"中火烧沸，加盖、小火炖；","img":"images/427306/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炖两小时左右即可。","img":"images/427306/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：瓦煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}